ot.news/items/cmpldcxz10ew3sl01caeact4o","https://www.theverge.com/news/936945/pope-leo-letter-encyclical-ai-anthropic-labor-warfare"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpldcxz10ew3sl01caeact4o","title":"教皇里奥呼吁在AI时代保持“深刻的人性”","originalTitle":"","summary":"教皇里奥十四世在首份重要通谕《Magnifica Humanitas》中警告了AI及不受约束的技术力量带来的风险。该通谕于2026年5月15日发布，是教皇关于“在人工智能时代守护人”的宣言。文件重点讨论了AI驱动战争的危险、AI对劳动的影响，以及建立新的法律和伦理框架来规范技术的必要性，强调AI的快速普及正造成经济和社会动荡，对个人的保护不足威胁着人类尊严。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpldcxz10ew3sl01caeact4o","originalUrl":"https://www.theverge.com/news/936945/pope-leo-letter-encyclical-ai-anthropic-labor-warfare","publishedAt":"2026-05-26T00:00:00.939Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-15u5q96","originalSourceName":"The Verge：AI（RSS）","family":"outlet-1q2yxza","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpldcxz10ew3sl01caeact4o","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T00:17:31.139Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-15u5q96","name":"The Verge：AI（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T00:17:31.139Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"教皇里奥十四世在首份重要通谕《Magnifica Humanitas》中警告了AI及不受约束的技术力量带来的风险。该通谕于2026年5月15日发布，是教皇关于“在人工智能时代守护人”的宣言。文件重点讨论了AI驱动战争的危险、AI对劳动的影响，以及建立新的法律和伦理框架来规范技术的必要性，强调AI的快速普及正造成经济和社会动荡，对个人的保护不足威胁着人类尊严。","reportEdition":"2026-05-26","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpltm5n30is2sl015yqdvfvt","title":"OpenAI GPT-5.6 模型曝下月发布：AI 上下文 150 万 tokens","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-05-26T00:00:00.939Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpltm5n30is2sl015yqdvfvt","https://www.ithome.com/0/955/078.htm"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpltm5n30is2sl015yqdvfvt","title":"OpenAI GPT-5.6 模型曝下月发布：AI 上下文 150 万 tokens","originalTitle":"","summary":"多名开发者在 OpenAI Codex 后端日志中发现未官宣的 GPT-5.6 模型，内部代号 iris-alpha。该模型将支持 150 万 token 的上下文窗口，较当前 GPT-5.5 的 105 万 token 提升约 43%，有望于今年 6 月发布。测试显示，在输入达到 90 万 token 时仍能流畅响应。同系列还发现了 ember-alpha 与 beacon-alpha 版本。此外，GPT-5.6 在前端界面生成能力上也有所提升。基于爆料信息，Anthropic Claude、Google Gemini 及 xAI Grok 也可能瞄准同期发布新模型。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpltm5n30is2sl015yqdvfvt","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/955/078.htm","publishedAt":"2026-05-26T00:00:00.939Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpltm5n30is2sl015yqdvfvt","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T00:17:31.139Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T00:17:31.139Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"多名开发者在 OpenAI Codex 后端日志中发现未官宣的 GPT-5.6 模型，内部代号 iris-alpha。该模型将支持 150 万 token 的上下文窗口，较当前 GPT-5.5 的 105 万 token 提升约 43%，有望于今年 6 月发布。测试显示，在输入达到 90 万 token 时仍能流畅响应。同系列还发现了 ember-alpha 与 beacon-alpha 版本。此外，GPT-5.6 在前端界面生成能力上也有所提升。基于爆料信息，Anthropic Claude、Google Gemini 及 xAI Grok 也可能瞄准同期发布新模型。","reportEdition":"2026-05-26","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":