1izzkuo8q","https://www.ithome.com/0/954/778.htm"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpkr0wyr09fisl01izzkuo8q","title":"华为何庭波“韬定律”论文发布，逻辑折叠技术提升芯片性能","originalTitle":"","summary":"华为何庭波在ISCAS 2026上提出“韬定律”，并介绍逻辑折叠（LogicFolding）技术。该技术通过三维空间拓扑重组提升芯片性能，不依赖新光刻工艺。在麒麟2026芯片测试中，晶体管密度从155 MTr/mm²提升至238 MTr/mm²，性能核心能效提高41%，最大时钟频率提升近13%。论文显示，麒麟2027芯片已进入Silicon状态，后续规划包括麒麟2028、2029。AI芯片方面，昇腾990计划在2030年左右引入逻辑折叠，硬件集成预计到2035年提高超过100倍。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpkr0wyr09fisl01izzkuo8q","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/954/778.htm","publishedAt":"2026-05-26T00:00:00.939Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpkr0wyr09fisl01izzkuo8q","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T00:17:31.139Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T00:17:31.139Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"华为何庭波在ISCAS 2026上提出“韬定律”，并介绍逻辑折叠（LogicFolding）技术。该技术通过三维空间拓扑重组提升芯片性能，不依赖新光刻工艺。在麒麟2026芯片测试中，晶体管密度从155 MTr/mm²提升至238 MTr/mm²，性能核心能效提高41%，最大时钟频率提升近13%。论文显示，麒麟2027芯片已进入Silicon状态，后续规划包括麒麟2028、2029。AI芯片方面，昇腾990计划在2030年左右引入逻辑折叠，硬件集成预计到2035年提高超过100倍。","reportEdition":"2026-05-26","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmplkklsy0gnysl019nmpl677","title":"Anthropic联合创始人Chris Olah在教皇通谕发布会上的讲话","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-05-26T00:00:00.939Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmplkklsy0gnysl019nmpl677","https://www.anthropic.com/news/chris-olah-pope-leo-encyclical"],"articles":[{"id":"cmplkklsy0gnysl019nmpl677","title":"Anthropic联合创始人Chris Olah在教皇通谕发布会上的讲话","originalTitle":"","summary":"Anthropic联合创始人Chris Olah在梵蒂冈出席教皇Leo XIV关于AI的通谕发布会。他指出，所有前沿AI实验室都面临商业、研究及地缘政治等多重压力，这可能与做正确的事相冲突，因此外部监督至关重要。他强调，AI模型并非像飞机那样被工程化构建，而是基于人类语言和思想“生长”出来的，其内在性质可能复杂难解。他提出三个需审慎思考的问题：如何确保AI发展的全球收益公平分享、如何思考AI时代的人类繁荣，以及AI模型内在性质的本质。他呼吁社会各界，尤其是宗教与民间团体，严肃审视AI发展并引导其向善。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmplkklsy0gnysl019nmpl677","originalUrl":"https://www.anthropic.com/news/chris-olah-pope-leo-encyclical","publishedAt":"2026-05-26T00:00:00.939Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-15gzes8","originalSourceName":"Anthropic：Newsroom（网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"official","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmplkklsy0gnysl019nmpl677","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T00:17:31.139Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-15gzes8","name":"Anthropic：Newsroom（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T00:17:31.139Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"Anthropic联合创始人Chris Olah在梵蒂冈出席教皇Leo XIV关于AI的通谕发布会。他指出，所有前沿AI实验室都面临商业、研究及地缘政治等多重压力，这可能与做正确的事相冲突，因此外部监督至关重要。他强调，AI模型并非像飞机那样被工程化构建，而是基于人类语言和思想“生长”出来的，其内在性质可能复杂难解。他提出三个需审慎思考的问题：如何确保AI发展的全球收益公平分享、如何思考AI时代的人类繁荣，以及AI模型内在性质的本质。他呼吁社会各界，尤其是宗教与民间团体，严肃审视AI发展并引导其向善。","reportEdition":"2026-05-26","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpleus3t0f8rsl01ztd88k2u","title":"Harness、Scaffold 与 AI 智能体术语辨析","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-05-26T00:00:00.939Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpleus3t0f8rsl01ztd88k2u","https://huggingface.co/blog/agent-glossary"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpleus3t0f8rsl01ztd88k2u","title":"Harness、Scaffold 与 AI 智能体术语辨析","originalTitle":"","summary":"本文旨在厘清 AI 智能体领域中易混淆的关键术语。文章指出，模型（如 Claude、GPT）本身是无记忆、无循环的大语言模型。其行为由“Scaffolding”（行为定义层，如系统提示、工具描述）塑造，而“Harness”（执行层）负责调用模型、处理工具调用与控制循环，是智能体运行的核心。两者结合，模型才能成为智能体。文章以 Claude Code、Codex 为例，说明同一模型搭配不同 Harness 会产生迥异体验，并提出了 Agent = Model + Harness 的常见理解框架。术语尚未统一，本文旨在提供一个实用的心智模型。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpleus3t0f8rsl01ztd88k2u","originalUrl":"https://huggingface.co/blog/agent-glossary","publishedAt":"2026-05-26T00:00:00.939Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-rb89q4","originalSourceName":"Hugging Face 社区博客（混合发现）","family":"outlet-1ohup8a","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpleus3t0f8rsl01ztd88k2u","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T00:17:31.139Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-rb89q4","name":"Hugging Face 社区博客（混合发现）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T00:17:31.139Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"本文旨在厘清 AI 智能体领域中易混淆的关键术语。文章指出，模型（如 Claude、GPT）本身是无记忆、无循环的大语言模型。其行为由“Scaffolding”（行为定义层，如系统提示、工具描述）塑造，而“Harness”（执行层）负责调用模型、处理工具调用与控制循环，是智能体运行的核心。两者结合，模型才能成为智能体。文章以 Claude Code、Codex 为例，说明同一模型搭配不同 Harness 会产生迥异体验，并提出了 Agent = Model + Harness 的常见理解框架。术语尚未统一，本文旨在提供一个实用的心智模型。","reportEdition":"2026-05-26","reportKind":"daily"}],"total":9,"partial":false,"itemSourceCount":7,"topics":[{"topic":"模型","count":1},{"topic":"应用","count":2},{"topic":"行业","count":3},{"topic":"研究","count":1},{"topic":"开发","count":2}],"method":"AIHOT 提供选题、摘要与编排；模境保留来源与报告窗口，关联模型数据。原报道与模型评测分别核对，不将资讯排名当作能力评分。"}}
